<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market calm, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market calm, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with  no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry fair, demand light.</p>
<p>This week's confirmed sales 72,100 head including 25,900 head or about 36 percent contracted or formulated cattle. Confirmed - none   last week - 50   last year - 200</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
